{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "Understanding", "depth": 1, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "He promised to support me and didn't. It's frustrating because we were close.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It's been happening a lot lately. I feel like I can't rely on him at all.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 73}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Yeah, it's like every time I need him, he's not there. It's really starting to wear on me.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 90}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "He promised to support me and didn't.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "I just wish he could be more dependable.", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 81}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "It’s just another reminder that I can’t count on anyone. I’m trying to stay positive, but this keeps hitting me hard.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "It's been tough, but I keep reminding myself that things will change. I just wish it would happen sooner.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Yeah, it's hard to keep going like this. I just wish he could be more dependable.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 81}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "We had big plans and he didn't follow through.", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, it's been hard. I thought we were closer than that.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Do you have any suggestions? But I don't know if anything will change things.", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 135}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I feel like I can't rely on anyone now.", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But thanks for listening. It helps to talk.", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 107}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's easier to talk about it, but it doesn't change how I feel.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 63}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "It's nice to have someone to talk to, but it doesn't make it better.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"session_id": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Do you have any suggestions?", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 86}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T210843Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T211731Z", "first_seen_session": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000003-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
